 "label": "Adrenaline Tunnel",
 "category": "Time",
 "tags": ["look"],
 "version": 1,
 "blurb": "Tunnel vision that comes and goes with what happens on screen. When the footage turns intense, sudden hits, explosions, something flying at the camera, a frantic scramble, the edges of sight close in, drain of colour, smear towards the middle and darken with a heartbeat pulsing in them; as things calm down the view opens out again. Several jolts close together close it further. Made for game footage, action and horror.",
